{start_of_verse: Intro}
[Dm]·  [Dm7]·   [Eb]·  · | [Bb]·  · [Bb]·  · (x2)
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
[Dm]   [Dm7]¿Qué-[Eb]e ·pasó?[Bb] · [Bb] ·
